{"task_id": "Mbpp/20", "solution": "def is_woodall(value: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if the given number is a Woodball number.\n    A Woodball number W is defined as W = n * 2^n - 1 for a non-negative integer n.\n    \"\"\"\n    if value <= 0:\n        return False\n\n    n = 1\n    while True:\n        woodball_candidate = n * (1 << n) - 1 # Using 1 << n for 2**n for potential minor optimization\n        if woodball_candidate == value:\n            return True\n        if woodball_candidate > value:\n            return False\n        n += 1"}
