{"task_id": "Mbpp/69", "solution": "def is_sublist(main_list, sub_list):\n    \"\"\"Checks if a sub_list is a contiguous subsequence of main_list.\n    Handles null inputs and empty sublists as specified.\"\"\"\n    if main_list is None or sub_list is None:\n        return False\n\n    if not sub_list:  # Handles empty sublist\n        return True\n\n    if len(sub_list) > len(main_list):\n        return False\n\n    for i in range(len(main_list) - len(sub_list) + 1):\n        if main_list[i:i+len(sub_list)] == sub_list:\n            return True\n            \n    return False"}
