{"task_id": "Mbpp/71", "solution": "def comb_sort(arr):\n    \"\"\"Sorts a list of elements using the Comb Sort algorithm.\"\"\"\n    n = len(arr)\n    if n == 0:\n        return []\n\n    # Create a copy to ensure the original list remains unchanged\n    sorted_arr = list(arr)\n\n    gap = n\n    swapped = True\n\n    while gap > 1 or swapped:\n        # Shrink gap by shrink factor 1.3\n        gap = max(1, int(gap / 1.3))\n\n        swapped = False\n        # Compare all elements with current gap\n        for i in range(n - gap):\n            if sorted_arr[i] > sorted_arr[i + gap]:\n                sorted_arr[i], sorted_arr[i + gap] = sorted_arr[i + gap], sorted_arr[i]\n                swapped = True\n    return sorted_arr"}
