{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "def sequence(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Returns the n-th term of the Newman\u2013Conway sequence.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n == 1 or n == 2:\n        return 1\n    if n == 3:\n        return 2\n\n    seq = [0, 1, 1, 2]  # seq[1] = 1, seq[2] = 1, seq[3] = 2\n    for i in range(4, n + 1):\n        seq.append(seq[seq[i - 1]] + seq[i - 2])\n\n    return seq[n]"}
