{"task_id": "Mbpp/101", "solution": "from typing import List\n\ndef kth_element(array: List[int], k: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Return the element at 1\u2011based position k from array.\n    Raises IndexError if input is invalid or k is out of bounds.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not array:\n        raise IndexError(\"Array is empty.\")\n    if k < 1:\n        raise IndexError(f\"k={k} is less than 1.\")\n    if k > len(array):\n        raise IndexError(f\"k={k} exceeds array length {len(array)}.\")\n    return array[k - 1]"}
