{"task_id": "Mbpp/108", "solution": "class IntegerList:\n    def __init__(self, elements):\n        \"\"\"Initializes an IntegerList with the given elements.\"\"\"\n        self.elements = list(elements)\n\n    def getElements(self):\n        \"\"\"Returns the internal list of elements.\"\"\"\n        return self.elements\n\nclass MergeService:\n    @staticmethod\n    def mergeSortedLists(list1: IntegerList, list2: IntegerList, list3: IntegerList) -> IntegerList:\n        \"\"\"Merges three IntegerList objects into a single sorted IntegerList.\"\"\"\n        combined_elements = []\n        combined_elements.extend(list1.getElements())\n        combined_elements.extend(list2.getElements())\n        combined_elements.extend(list3.getElements())\n        \n        sorted_elements = sorted(combined_elements)\n        return IntegerList(sorted_elements)\n\ndef merge_sorted_list(list1, list2, list3):\n    \"\"\"\n    Merges three lists into a single sorted list using internal service components.\n    \"\"\"\n    integer_list1 = IntegerList(list1)\n    integer_list2 = IntegerList(list2)\n    integer_list3 = IntegerList(list3)\n\n    merged_integer_list = MergeService.mergeSortedLists(integer_list1, integer_list2, integer_list3)\n\n    return merged_integer_list.getElements()"}
