{"task_id": "Mbpp/137", "solution": "def zero_count(arr):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the ratio of zeroes to non-zeroes in an array of integers.\n    Returns 0.0 for an empty array.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not arr:\n        return 0.0\n\n    zeroes = 0\n    non_zeroes = 0\n    for x in arr:\n        if x == 0:\n            zeroes += 1\n        else:\n            non_zeroes += 1\n\n    if non_zeroes == 0:\n        raise ZeroDivisionError(\"No non-zero elements found in the array.\")\n    \n    return float(zeroes) / non_zeroes"}
