{"task_id": "Mbpp/167", "solution": "def next_power_of_2(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the smallest power of 2 greater than or equal to n.\n    Handles non-positive inputs and inputs that are already powers of 2 using bitwise operations.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n <= 0:\n        return 1\n    # Check if n is already a power of 2\n    if (n & (n - 1)) == 0:\n        return n\n    \n    # Compute the next power of 2 for positive n that is not a power of 2\n    n -= 1\n    n |= n >> 1\n    n |= n >> 2\n    n |= n >> 4\n    n |= n >> 8\n    n |= n >> 16\n    n += 1\n    return n"}
