{"task_id": "Mbpp/283", "solution": "def validate(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if the frequency of each digit in the integer is less than or equal to the digit itself.\n    The validation uses the absolute value of the input number.\n    \"\"\"\n    number_str = str(abs(number))\n    digit_counts = [0] * 10 \n\n    for char_digit in number_str:\n        digit = int(char_digit)\n        digit_counts[digit] += 1\n\n    for digit_value in range(10):\n        if digit_counts[digit_value] > digit_value:\n            return False\n\n    return True"}
