{"task_id": "Mbpp/420", "solution": "def cube_Sum(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the cubes of the first n even natural numbers.\n    For n <= 0, the sum is 0.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n <= 0:\n        return 0\n    \n    total_sum = 0\n    for k in range(1, n + 1):\n        even_number = 2 * k\n        total_sum += even_number ** 3\n    return total_sum"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/422", "solution": "def find_Average_Of_Cube(n: int) -> float:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the average of cubes of the first n natural numbers.\n    This function assumes n is a positive integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    # The sum of cubes of the first n natural numbers is given by (n * (n + 1) / 2)^2.\n    # The average is this sum divided by n.\n    average = n * (n + 1)**2 / 4\n    return average"}
