{"task_id": "Mbpp/453", "solution": "def sumofFactors(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of all even factors of a given number n.\n    The algorithm iterates up to the square root of n to find factors.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    i = 1\n    while i * i <= n:\n        if n % i == 0:\n            # i is a factor\n            if i % 2 == 0:\n                total_sum += i\n            \n            # n // i is the other factor\n            if i * i != n:  # Avoid double-counting for perfect squares\n                other_factor = n // i\n                if other_factor % 2 == 0:\n                    total_sum += other_factor\n        i += 1\n    return total_sum"}
