{"task_id": "Mbpp/457", "solution": "def Find_Min(list_of_lists):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the sublist with the minimum length from a list of lists.\n    If multiple sublists have the same minimum length, the first one encountered is returned.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not list_of_lists:\n        return []\n\n    min_length = float('inf')\n    min_sublist = []\n\n    for sublist in list_of_lists:\n        if len(sublist) < min_length:\n            min_length = len(sublist)\n            min_sublist = sublist\n\n    return min_sublist"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/459", "solution": "def remove_uppercase(s):\n    \"\"\"\n    Removes all contiguous uppercase substrings from the input string.\n    Iterates through the string, skipping sequences of uppercase characters.\n    \"\"\"\n    result = []\n    i = 0\n    n = len(s)\n\n    while i < n:\n        if s[i].isupper():\n            # Skip contiguous uppercase letters\n            while i < n and s[i].isupper():\n                i += 1\n        else:\n            result.append(s[i])\n            i += 1\n\n    return \"\".join(result)"}
