{"task_id": "Mbpp/463", "solution": "def max_subarray_product(array):\n    # Finds the maximum product of a contiguous subarray within the given array.\n    # It dynamically tracks max and min products ending at the current position, handling zeros correctly.\n\n    max_so_far = array[0]\n    max_ending_here = array[0]\n    min_ending_here = array[0]\n\n    for i in range(1, len(array)):\n        x = array[i]\n        \n        # Store the current max_ending_here before its potential update\n        # for accurate min_ending_here calculation.\n        temp_max_ending_here = max_ending_here\n\n        if x == 0:\n            # Reset current product trackers to 1 to start a new product sequence;\n            # potentially update the global max with 0.\n            max_ending_here = 1\n            min_ending_here = 1\n            max_so_far = max(max_so_far, 0)\n        else:\n            # Update max and min products ending at the current position,\n            # then update the overall maximum product found so far.\n            max_ending_here = max(x, temp_max_ending_here * x, min_ending_here * x)\n            min_ending_here = min(x, temp_max_ending_here * x, min_ending_here * x)\n            max_so_far = max(max_so_far, max_ending_here)\n\n    return max_so_far"}
