{"task_id": "Mbpp/605", "solution": "def prime_num(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if the given integer is a prime number using trial division up to its square root.\n    Returns True if prime, False otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n <= 1:\n        return False\n    if n == 2 or n == 3:\n        return True\n    if n % 2 == 0:\n        return False\n    \n    # Check for odd divisors from 3 up to sqrt(n)\n    i = 3\n    while i * i <= n:\n        if n % i == 0:\n            return False\n        i += 2\n    return True"}
