{"task_id": "Mbpp/730", "solution": "def consecutive_duplicates(input_list):\n    \"\"\"\n    Removes consecutive duplicates from a list, preserving order and not mutating the input.\n    A new list is returned with only unique consecutive elements.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not input_list:\n        return []\n\n    result = []\n    for item in input_list:\n        if not result or item != result[-1]:\n            result.append(item)\n    return result"}
