{"task_id": "Mbpp/274", "solution": "def even_binomial_Coeff_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of even-indexed binomial coefficients for a given positive integer n.\n    Raises ValueError if n is not a positive integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(n, int) or n <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"n must be a positive integer.\")\n\n    current_coeff = 1\n    total_sum = 0\n\n    for k in range(n + 1):\n        if k % 2 == 0:\n            total_sum += current_coeff\n        \n        # Calculate next binomial coefficient C(n, k+1) using C(n, k)\n        # C(n, k+1) = C(n, k) * (n - k) / (k + 1)\n        if k < n:\n            current_coeff = current_coeff * (n - k) // (k + 1)\n            \n    return total_sum"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/391", "solution": "def convert_list_dictionary(keys, names, scores):\n    \"\"\"\n    Converts three parallel lists into a list of nested dictionaries.\n    Each item in the result maps a key to a dictionary of name and score.\n    \"\"\"\n    result = []\n    for key, name, score in zip(keys, names, scores):\n        result.append({key: {name: score}})\n    return result"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/286", "solution": "from typing import List\n\ndef max_sub_array_sum_repeated(array: List[int], n: int, k: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the largest sum of a contiguous subarray in the modified array\n    formed by repeating the given array k times using an O(N) approach.\n    \"\"\"\n    # Use Kadane's algorithm to find the maximum subarray sum within a single copy of the array.\n    max_so_far = array[0]\n    current_max_kadane = array[0]\n    for i in range(1, n):\n        current_max_kadane = max(array[i], current_max_kadane + array[i])\n        max_so_far = max(max_so_far, current_max_kadane)\n    \n    max_single_kadane = max_so_far\n\n    if k == 1:\n        return max_single_kadane\n\n    # Calculate total sum, maximum prefix sum, and maximum suffix sum of the original array.\n    total_sum = sum(array)\n    max_prefix, current_prefix_sum = float('-inf'), 0\n    for x in array:\n        current_prefix_sum += x\n        max_prefix = max(max_prefix, current_prefix_sum)\n\n    max_suffix, current_suffix_sum = float('-inf'), 0\n    for i in range(n - 1, -1, -1):\n        current_suffix_sum += array[i]\n        max_suffix = max(max_suffix, current_suffix_sum)\n\n    # Combine these sums to find the overall maximum for k > 1 repetitions.\n    ans = max_single_kadane\n    ans = max(ans, max_prefix + max_suffix) # Accounts for subarrays spanning two adjacent blocks.\n    if total_sum > 0:\n        ans = max(ans, max_prefix + (k - 2) * total_sum + max_suffix) # Accounts for subarrays spanning multiple blocks.\n    \n    return ans"}
